@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@
+# Accumulated platform and dispatch changes
+
+Starting source: the completed shared-writer delivery at
+`720749d28ba8011a6d1e8f0f17430981e5080bb8`. This delivery includes that entire tree
+and the earlier build-boundary and application repairs. No GitHub reconciliation,
+merge, push or remote workflow run was performed for this batch.
+
+## This batch
+
+- Completed instruction 7.5 with one typed backend registry. Named mixin wrappers
+  remain available. Package, result and inventory types remain distinct, and
+  backend functions are looked up at invocation time so existing monkeypatches
+  continue to work. Workload/VKS pre-publication checks are unchanged.
+- Captured 22 dispatch cases before the refactor, covering all target families,
+  resolution/publication/inventory wrappers, mixed repository formats and host
+  predicate short-circuiting. Preserved the actual Arch-first precedence rather
+  than treating an explicit APT repository format as an unconditional override.
+- Added Linux GUI/CLI source launchers, per-user installation, desktop integration,
+  isolated pinned dependencies and an offline wheel-directory option. CLI-only
+  installation requires neither Tk nor a display. Normal launches preserve
+  caller-relative paths and CLI status codes, without installing dependencies.
+- Installation creates environments at permanent paths and switches to them only
+  after probes pass. Failed upgrades preserve the selected runtime and restore
+  changed shortcuts. Unmanaged shortcut files are protected from replacement.
+- Added an installed-client check using a genuine DEB/local APT repository and the
+  real GUI. Added required Debian 12 and Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 CI jobs that install
+  CLI-only first, then add Tk and upgrade to GUI support.
+- Corrected Windows installer quoting for paths containing spaces, set the current
+  process's Tcl/Tk paths before probing the interpreter, and retained installer
+  and bootstrap logs in both Windows workflow jobs. The interpreter version,
+  installer hash and verification requirements remain unchanged.
+- Documented why payload filename maps use object identity (instruction 8.3).
+  The mapping mechanism and bundle formats are unchanged.
+
+## Evidence
+
+The authoritative full-tree outcome is `validation/platform-gate/SUMMARY.md`.
+`validation/platform/` contains focused tests, static checks, the before-refactor
+characterization, installed-client output, packaging checks and a cumulative
+patch. The source digest identifies the complete modified tree; it is not a
+claim that the changes have been merged or committed upstream.
+
+Local installation was performed from a directory containing spaces, a quote,
+a dollar sign and a percent sign, using actual pinned wheels with index access
+disabled. The installed GUI opened under Xvfb on Ubuntu 24.04; its CLI built a
+real DEB bundle without a display. Windows native execution and the new remote
+Debian/Ubuntu matrix remain unverified. Windows changes address concrete code
+issues and missing diagnostics; they do not establish the root cause or resolution
+of the previously observed Windows CI failure. A separate native APT oracle attempt
+was blocked by the local runner's denied setgroups/setuid operations before it
+could read the fixture repository. Its failure is retained, not counted as a pass;
+DNF and pacman are not installed here. Existing required native-conformance CI
+jobs remain intact.
+
+## Still to do
+
+- Run the added Linux matrix and Windows bootstrap/source/frozen-build gates after
+  the accumulated changes are merged. Resolve actual failures from their logs.
+- Instruction 8.1: retain verified digests with explicit artifact identity and
+  invalidation, then measure the reduction in hashing. Blindly caching a digest
+  on a mutable package record could attach it to different bytes.
+- Instruction 8.2: profile provider-index rebuilding before choosing an optimization.
+- Instruction 9: extract small core responsibilities once the efficiency work is
+  stable, retaining legacy import and patching seams.
+- Native `.deb` application packaging, if required beyond the source installer.
+
+The Windows quoting repair follows the documented
+[Start-Process argument handling](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/microsoft.powershell.management/start-process).
